00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.800
I'd be embarrassed to do that 
in front of Kuromine-kun.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:53.680
You're going to run away just
because of that, cool beauty?

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.690
That's that, then.

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:57.310
You lose by default.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.930
I win without even trying.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.350
I'm the more grown-up one.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.440
I-I'm not giving up!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.150
<b>Swimsuit Battle</b>

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.200
<i>Sh-Shiragami in a swimsuit!</i>

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:14.400
How's this?!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.160
Weak!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.660
Koumoto

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:21.660
Take this!

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:24.600
R-Right.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:28.040
I didn't want to see my 
great-great-grandmother like this.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:35.050
Bastard!

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:36.680
I'm not gonna lose!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.470
<b>Dance-off</b>

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.450
<b>Cosplay Battle</b>

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.620
'Nana, 'nana! 'Nana, 'nana!

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:05.430
Meow.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.880
N-Not bad.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.420
Same to you.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.130
P-Please stop.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.960
If it's come to this...

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:19.260
Behold my secret weapon!

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:22.740
The power of a millenia-old devil

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:25.200
bent on ensnaring humanity!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.450
Pervert power!

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:34.360
That's obviously cheating!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.920
Perhaps it's about time

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.450
we finished this?

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:48.250
Well, I'm satisfied.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.380
Okay, good luck with the rest, you two.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.870
D-Damn you. I'm not done yet!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.260
I-I won't lose!

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:58.760
The next contest is this!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:02.720
I believe a grown-up shouldn't 
show any distress when

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.270
they eat cream puffs with 
awful things inside them.

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:06.680
Even if

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.210
it's these Russian cream puffs

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.860
made with Akemi-san's help.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.110
R-Russian cream puffs?!

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.250
They're done.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:20.410
The most powerful, most 
terrible Russian cream puffs.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.030
What the hell have you done, Mikan?!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:26.320
The one who can keep a straight face 
eating these wins. How's that?

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:28.450
No, no, Russian or not,

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:30.870
I'm pretty sure <i>all</i> of those are bad!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:32.460
I'm not eating that!

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:35.400
Well, that's that, then.

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:36.220
What?

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:38.240
You lose by default.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:39.720
I win without even trying.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.430
I'm the more grown-up one.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.110
Very well.

00:18:46.110 --> 00:18:50.530
It's a grown-up's duty to put 
up with a reckless child.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:55.570
It's a grown-up's duty to 
lovingly give lessons in reality.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:03.120
Distance: 30, 20...

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.950
Demonization signal amplitude increasing.

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.660
It's getting even stronger?

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.370
What could possibly lie ahead?

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:16.810
U-Um, Koumoto-sensei...

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.950
What is it, Kuromine?

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:23.370
How old is the principal, anyway?

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:25.600
All I know is

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.480
she's looked the same since I was a kid.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.960
So it's really true.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.320
But that aside, Kuromine...

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:38.440
I heard you're keeping Shiragami's secret for her.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.790
H-How did you...

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:43.030
The principal told me.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:45.460
She's clairvoyant or something.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:48.760
She knows more or less everything 
that goes on in the school.

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:51.250
A-Anything goes, huh?

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.550
It's not over yet!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:59.060
Anyway, Kuromine,

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:02.550
keep Shiragami's secret safe.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:07.600
Even if it's 100% ulterior motives.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:12.280
I don't want my students 
quitting school, after all.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.800
I-It's not <i>all</i> ulterior motives.

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:18.080
I think.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.020
I'm more grown-up!

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.280
No, I am!

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:27.690
The gym?

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:29.610
This is the epicenter?

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.440
Demonization signal increasing rapidly.

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.960
Just what is going on?

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.260
Wha...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.020
Oh, no!

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:56.070
Heat wave and blast incoming.

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:56.770
No!

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:09.490
Warning! Warning!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.870
Hull damage at 80%. 
Craft at risk of crashing.

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:15.870
I can't believe the gym just exploded.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:19.010
What a terrifying planet Earth is!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:44.330
I'm sure it'll be rough taking care of them,

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.790
but let's both do our best, Kuromine.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.240
Right, Koumoto-sensei.

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:25.210
<b>Koumoto Akane's
Say-Ten-Times Quiz of the Devil!!</b>

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Say-Ten-Times Quiz of the Devil!

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:25.210
Say "single" ten times fast.

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:29.740
Single, single, single, single, single, 
single, single, single, single, single.

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:30.720
Akari, he's calling you.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.690
Who are you calling a lonely old spinster?!

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:35.790
She summoned Koumoto-sensei the spinster

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:37.850
by having him say "single" over and over?

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:39.720
Is this the true work of the devil?

00:23:39.720 --> 00:23:42.100
You're not allowed to call me a spinster!

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:45.040
Your youth is your undoing.

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:46.940
In battle, you must always think
two to three steps ahead—

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:49.620
This is your doing!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:50.990
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Save the World!"</b>
